Branch wws-stretch-xvnc of the TigerVNC fork: Debian stretch's tigervnc
1.7.0+dfsg-7+deb9u1 (pristine orig + debian/ from archive.debian.org) with
the server sides of the fork's features as additional patches, for the
Xtigervnc of the Schlaile WWS tills (stretch-i386, X server 1.19, which
TigerVNC master no longer supports):

  debian/patches/wws-file-drop-endpoint.patch   VNC File Drop (file-drop)
  debian/patches/wws-x509-client-ca.patch       client certificates
                                                (client-cert)

This is the only stretch branch: every feature's backport goes here as a
patch of its own (quilt, QUILT_PATCHES=debian/patches; unapply all before
committing).

Built on Bob: bob-build submit --target stretch-i386 (in this worktree).
